{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@attached"},{"kind":"text","text":"(extension, conformances: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"System","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Systems6SystemP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/MainActorSystem","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MainActorSystem","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Systems15MainActorSystemP"},{"kind":"text","text":", names: named(access), named(run), named(initialize)) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"System"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Attach ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@System"},{"text":" to a structure with a method named ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"run"},{"text":". The method’s parameters are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"system parameters, values the schedule fetches from the world before each run, and their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"types state exactly what the system reads and writes. The macro conforms the type to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", writing its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System\/access","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" from those types and a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System\/run(in:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fetches the parameters and calls your method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following system moves each entity by its velocity plus whichever of a wind and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current act on it, scaled by the time step:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct Wind: Component { var speed: Double }","struct Current: Component { var speed: Double }","","@System","struct Drift {","    func run(","        _ drifters: Update<Position>.Over<Velocity, AnyOf<Wind, Current>>,","        _ step: ResourceReader<TimeStep>","    ) {","        drifters { position, row in","            let (velocity, (wind, current)) = row.components","            let push = (wind?.speed ?? 0) + (current?.speed ?? 0)","            position.x += (velocity.dx + push) * step.value.seconds","        }","    }","}","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(TimeStep(seconds: 0.5))","let boat = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 2, dy: 0), Wind(speed: 4))","Schedule { Drift() }.run(on: &world)","print(world[Position.self, of: boat].x)","\/\/ Prints \"3.0\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Drift"},{"type":"text","text":" writes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":", reads "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Velocity"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wind"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Current"},{"type":"text","text":" and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeStep"},{"type":"text","text":" resource,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and nothing else, so a schedule runs it at the same time as any system that doesn’t write"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"those types."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"These are the parameter types a ","type":"text"},{"code":"run","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method can take:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"termList","items":[{"definition":{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reads components."}]}]},"term":{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where","isActive":true}]}},{"definition":{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Writes components, optionally reading others.","type":"text"}]}]},"term":{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Update","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}},{"definition":{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Read or write a resource.","type":"text"}]}]},"term":{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceReader"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceWriter"}]}},{"definition":{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Read or send events."}]}]},"term":{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventWriter"}]}},{"definition":{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lists the entities that lost a component."}]}]},"term":{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents","isActive":true}]}},{"definition":{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Queues structural changes, which apply at the end of the system’s wave and conflict with nothing."}]}]},"term":{"inlineContent":[{"code":"inout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"run","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method that takes the world instead, as ","type":"text"},{"code":"inout World","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", makes a system with no access,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which can change anything and so runs alone:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@System","struct SpawnBall {","    func run(in world: inout World) {","        world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 100), Velocity(dx: 0, dy: 0))","    }","}","","var world = World()","Schedule { SpawnBall() }.run(on: &world)","print(world.count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Mark the type or its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"run"},{"text":" method ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@MainActor"},{"text":" to make a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/MainActorSystem"},{"text":" instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The macro reads only the method’s signature. Two parameters whose written types conflict,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as an "},{"code":"Update<Position>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and a "},{"code":"Query<Position>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", are a compile-time error. A conflict the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written types hide, such as one type spelled through a type alias, traps when the system is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scheduled."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The code the macro generates refers to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"World"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Access"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Commands"},{"type":"text","text":", so the file must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"import "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ECS"},{"type":"text","text":", or both "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WorldModule"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Systems"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Makes a type a system whose access comes from the parameters of its ","type":"text"},{"code":"run","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/system()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/DeclaringSystems","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/DrivingAWorldFromAnApp","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Systems"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"System"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SystemMacro.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Systems\/SystemMacro.swift#L81"},"symbolKind":"macro","externalID":"s:7Systems6Systemyycfm","roleHeading":"Macro","title":"System()"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Query":{"abstract":[{"text":"A description of the entities to visit and the components to read from each.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/query","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Query","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Query","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{